### 2. Sprint Retrospective Summary

**Purpose:** Track retrospective outcomes and team improvement over time.

#### Latest Retro Mood

**Energy Level Indicators:**

| Mood | Emoji | Description | Action |
|------|-------|-------------|--------|
| Energized | ⚡ | High energy, motivated | Maintain |
| Positive | 😊 | Good spirits, optimistic | Encourage |
| Neutral | 😐 | Steady, neither up nor down | Engage |
| Tired | 😴 | Fatigued, low energy | Rest |
| Frustrated | 😤 | Annoyed, blocked | Address |

#### Action Items Status

| Status | Count | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| Completed | 8 | Done this sprint |
| In Progress | 3 | Being worked on |
| Not Started | 2 | Backlog for next sprint |
| Blocked | 1 | Has impediments |

**Completion Rate:**
```
Completion % = (Completed / Total) × 100
Target: > 70%
```

#### Retention Metrics

| Metric | Value | Target | Status |
|--------|-------|--------|--------|
| Retention Rate | 94% | > 90% | 🟢 |
| Voluntary Turnover | 6% | < 10% | 🟢 |
| Team Tenure (avg) | 2.5 years | > 2 years | 🟢 |
| Open Positions | 1 | < 2 | 🟢 |

**Retention Rate Calculation:**
```
Retention Rate = (Employees at End - New Hires) / Employees at Start × 100
```

